sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as go build
  participant O as otelc toolexec
  participant C as go tool compile
  loop every package
    G->>O: compile args…
    opt package matches a rule
      O->>O: parse (dave/dst), apply rules,<br/>optimize trampolines
      O->>O: swap rewritten files in,<br/>patch -importcfg
    end
    O->>C: compile args…
    C-->>G: package archive
  end
